rectangle "eFTI Gate Service\n<size:10>[Container: Java 21+, Spring Boot]</size>" <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService>> {
  rectangle "==Povezovalnik eDelivery\n<size:10>[Component: Java]</size>\n\nAbstrakcija komunikacije z dostopno točko AS4; preslikava korelacijskih identifikatorjev v glavo AS4." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.PovezovalnikeDelivery>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.PovezovalnikeDelivery
  rectangle "==Odjemalec WS (WS Plugin)\n<size:10>[Component: Java, SOAP]</size>\n\nSOAP odjemalec za Domibus WS plugin." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.OdjemalecWSWSPlugin>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.OdjemalecWSWSPlugin
  rectangle "==Jedro (Gate Core)\n<size:10>[Component: Spring Boot]</size>\n\nObdelava zahtev prek UIL, iskanj po identifikatorjih in follow-up communication; vloga requesting eFTI Gate in receiving eFTI Gate; časovna omejitev 60 s." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.JedroGateCore>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.JedroGateCore
  rectangle "==Search mechanism\n<size:10>[Component: Java]</size>\n\nIz UIL razbere eFTI Gate in eFTI Platform, išče v Registry of Identifiers, posreduje iskanja drugim eFTI Gate, združi rezultate (čl. 8; TGD §6.2–6.3)." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Searchmechanism>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Searchmechanism
  rectangle "==Registry of Identifiers\n<size:10>[Component: Java]</size>\n\nNalaganje, zamenjava, aktivacija, deaktivacija in izbris UIL z identifikatorji; nastavljiv nabor identifikatorjev (čl. 11; TGD §6.1, 6.4)." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.RegistryofIdentifiers>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.RegistryofIdentifiers
  rectangle "==Registri povezav\n<size:10>[Component: Java]</size>\n\nRegister eFTI Gate drugih DČ (ID, certifikati), register AAP (ID, certifikati), Registry of eFTI Platforms (ID, ključi, certifikacijski status, politika priklopa) (čl. 6(3)(d)–(f))." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Registripovezav>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Registripovezav
}

hexagon "==eFTI Gate AAP API (#3)\n<size:10>[Container: REST/JSON, mTLS, OAuth 2.0]</size>\n\nOpenAPI: zahteve prek UIL, iskanja po identifikatorjih, follow-up communication; asinhrono (requestId). Pot /v1/aap/control/..." <<eFTIGate.eFTIGateAAPAPI3>> as eFTIGate.eFTIGateAAPAPI3
database "==Podatkovna baza eFTI Gate\n<size:10>[Container: PostgreSQL]</size>\n\nRegistry of Identifiers, registri povezav, stanje zahtev." <<eFTIGate.PodatkovnabazaeFTIGate>> as eFTIGate.PodatkovnabazaeFTIGate
rectangle "==eDelivery Access Point\n<size:10>[Container: Domibus (EK), AS4]</size>\n\nAS4 za #1 (statično odkrivanje) in #2 (SML/SMP); PMode po TGD Annex 1; ključi v HSM." <<eFTIGate.eDeliveryAccessPoint>> as eFTIGate.eDeliveryAccessPoint

eFTIGate.eFTIGateAAPAPI3 .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.JedroGateCore : "<color:#707070>1. Iskanje (npr. registrska oznaka)"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.JedroGateCore .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Searchmechanism : "<color:#707070>2. Išči"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Searchmechanism .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.RegistryofIdentifiers : "<color:#707070>3. Lokalni zadetki"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Searchmechanism .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Registripovezav : "<color:#707070>4. Seznam eFTI Gate"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.Searchmechanism .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.PovezovalnikeDelivery : "<color:#707070>5. Posreduj iskanje vsem eFTI Gate"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.PovezovalnikeDelivery .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.OdjemalecWSWSPlugin : "<color:#707070>6. Pošlji"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.OdjemalecWSWSPlugin .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eDeliveryAccessPoint : "<color:#707070>7. #1 G2G iskanje\n<color:#707070><size:8>[SOAP/HTTPS]</size>"
eFTIGate.eDeliveryAccessPoint .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.PovezovalnikeDelivery : "<color:#707070>8. Delni rezultati drugih eFTI Gate\n<color:#707070><size:8>[JMS/WS]</size>"
eFTIGate.eFTIGateService.JedroGateCore .[#707070,thickness=2].> eFTIGate.PodatkovnabazaeFTIGate : "<color:#707070>9. Asinhrono: sprotni rezultati; sinhrono: združeni s statusi\n<color:#707070><size:8>[JDBC]</size>"
@enduml